racts a huge traffic inflow. However, the opulent weather conditions along with the provision of almost all basic facilities and amenities can also be termed as the scoring factors. Many facilities like reputed primary and secondary schools, junior colleges, shopping malls, hospitals, clinics, and more have been conveniently placed within proximity to the location. Apart from these, many petrol stations, well-known hospitals like Parkcity Dental @ Waterfront, Leong Hoon Leok Acupuncure & Medical Center, many major banks, and more can be found. The project has been created over a huge piece of land of about 4.27 acres, the project is a mini township of the Desa ParkCity. Consisting of about 47 storey and a total of 469 residential units, the average built-up size of the residential unit varies from 1,077sf to 1,927sf. Furthermore, the units have also been divided into six different layouts, namely, Type A1, Type A2, Type A3, Type B1, Type C1, and Type C2. Each residential unit has been decorated using high-quality interiors with pre-approved air-conditioners. Similarly, each bathroom has also been provided with a hot water supply and shower screens. Besides this, an intercom has been provided to each residential unit for added security which is then directly connected to the security system. While the sub-sale price of the units can vary from RM 899,999-RM 1,750,000, the rental charges, however, remain between RM 1-RM 1,068.Project Name: Westside IIIConfiguration: 469 residential unitsThe following developments are in the same neighbourhood as Westside III:The Westside OneOne Central Park @ Desa ParkCityThe Westside IIThe Northshore GardensThe BreezeWay Garden Condo\n\nRead more\n\nProject details\n\nType Condominium\n\nPrice RM 710K - 2.5M\n\nCompletion year 2019\n\nTenure Freehold\n\nNo. of blocks 1\n\nNo. of floors 47\n\nTotal units 469\n\nTop facilities\n\n24-hour security\n\nBbq\n\nCommunity garden\n\nGym\n\n* * *\n\nDeveloper Perdana Park City sdn Bhd\n\nWestsi