esent a price rise of 14.29%. The estimated gross rental yield is 5.32% based on current project rental listings and matched historical sale transactions.\n\n###### Who It's For\n\nYoung Families\nOn-site facilities such as a gym, a playground, and tennis courts suit an active family lifestyle, with 24-hour security provided for a long-term family purchase. The Early Years Center is 931 m away, an 11-minute walk, which helps to simplify the daily school run. For those seeking family-sized homes, 2-Bedroom units are priced slightly below the Desa Parkcity average, while 3-Bedroom and 4-Bedroom units are priced well below the Desa Parkcity average.\n\n* * *\n\n###### Ready to Make Your Move?\n\n76 homes are currently for sale at Westside Three, starting from RM710,000. See what's currently on the market and compare layouts side by side.\n\nThis copy was published on 25 September 2026.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSunway Geosense, Subang Jaya Property Prices: Median RM745k (https://list.my/subsales/selangor/petaling/bdr-sunway/sunway-geosense?group_by_size=true)\nciteturn241search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 3 days ago; ### Property Transactions ... 678 sqft · RM928 PSF ... Sunway Geosense in Petaling, Selangor recorded 47 subsale transactions between 2021 and 2026, with a median price of RM745K and a median price per square foot (PSF) of RM1,069.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n39 Condominium For Sale in Kuala Langat, Selangor, May 2026 (https://www.mudah.my/selangor-kuala-langat/condominium-for-sale)\nciteturn241search5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 months ago; Condominium for sale 3w RM 450,000 The Parque Residences @ Eco Sanctuary, Telok Panglima Garang 731 sq.ft 1 Bed 1 Bath Freehold The Parque Residences Eco Sanctuary | 1R1B | 731 sqft | 2 Car Parks | ... Condominium for auction 10/03 RM 276,200 Telok Panglima Garang, Selangor 1,001 sq.ft 3 Bed 2 Bath Leaseho